### Un fournisseur

POST {{baseUrl}}/fournisseurs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenYara}}

{
  "code": "FOUR-001",
  "nom": "Samsung France",
  "email": "contact@samsung.fr",
  "pays": "France",
  "contactNom": "Jean Dupont"
}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/commandes-achat
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenYara}}

### Stats globales (admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenYara}}

### Top produits
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/top-produits?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenYara}}

### Top clients
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/top-clients?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenYara}}

###  CA mensuel
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/ca-mensuel
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenYara}}